{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"653e1470-9eec-4042-b720-1af7afadcad7","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The schema analysis has been completed and written to [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of What Isn't in 3NF\n\nWhile migration [`20261010040000_normal_forms.sql`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261010040000_normal_forms.sql) addressed many normalization issues, it deliberately adopted a **\"mixed approach, not textbook 3NF\"**, and later migrations (`20261014010000_github_board_results.sql`, `20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql`) introduced additional non-3NF elements:\n\n1. **Copied `project_id` on Child Tables (Transitive \u0026 Partial Key Dependencies)**:\n   - **2NF violations**: In [`idea_items`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261008230200_backend_v1.sql#L90-L98) (candidate key `(idea_id, item_id)`) and [`document_chunks`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261008230100_knowledge_chunks.sql#L30-L52) (candidate key `(document_id, ord)`), `project_id` depends on a proper subset of the composite candidate key (`idea_id -\u003e project_id`, `document_id -\u003e project_id`).\n   - **Transitive dependencies**: In [`identities`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261008170000_init.sql#L126), [`items`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261008170000_init.sql#L141), [`touches`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261008170000_init.sql#L194), [`project_memory`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261008170000_init.sql#L213), [`documents`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261008170000_init.sql#L225), [`model_calls`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql#L15), and [`code_questions`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql#L56), `project_id` is redundant because child records already link to a parent entity that belongs to a single project.\n\n2. **Denormalized Aggregates Maintained by Triggers**:\n   - [`people.first_touch_at` and `last_touch_at`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261010040000_normal_forms.sql#L200-L222): Cached aggregates ($\\min$ and $\\max$ of `touches.occurred_at`) updated via trigger `touches_person_span`.\n   - [`ideas.asked_by`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261010040000_normal_forms.sql#L76-L96): Cached count of distinct people who asked for the idea, updated via trigger `ideas_recount`.\n\n3. **Embedded External Entities (Transitive Dependencies)**:\n   - **GitHub Projects Board** in [`projects`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261014010000_github_board_results.sql#L17-L24): `(github_board_owner, github_board_number) \u003c-\u003e github_board_id -\u003e github_board_title`. The GitHub board title is cached display data for an external entity.\n   - **GitHub Issue State** in [`ideas`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261014010000_github_board_results.sql#L27-L39): Issue lifecycle attributes (`state`, `state_reason`, `closed_at`, `board_status`) depend on `(github_issue_repo, github_issue_number)`.\n   - **GitHub Account** in [`github_installations`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261010030000_github_app.sql#L9-L21): `account_id -\u003e (account_login, account_type)`.\n\n4. **Redundant Columns Duplicate with JSONB Fields**:\n   - [`model_calls`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql#L28-L31): Plain mutable columns `tokens_in`, `tokens_out`, and `cost_usd` store values duplicate with `usage jsonb`.\n   - [`code_questions`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql#L73-L74): `cost_usd` is stored both as a column and inside `usage jsonb`.\n   - [`voice_samples`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261010010000_sources_voice_knowledge.sql#L25-L26): `quality real` is duplicate with `scores jsonb`.\n   - [`themes.position`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261008170000_init.sql#L99) vs [`project_memory`](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/supabase/migrations/20261008170000_init.sql#L217): Duplicate representation of the team's position on a theme.\n\n5. **Stored Generated Columns**:\n   - Intra-row functional dependencies persisted to disk: `items.triage_*` from `triage`, `drafts.tokens_in/tokens_out` from `tokens`, `documents.is_public` from `label`, and `projects.url_key` from `url`.\n\n6. **1NF Non-Atomic Structures (Precluding 3NF)**:\n   - **Composite strings**: `source_syncs.source` (`devto:writing:\u003chandle\u003e`, `github:\u003crepo\u003e`) and `voice_samples.external_id`.\n   - **Multi-valued arrays**: `founders.languages`, `projects.languages`, `projects.topics`, `projects.competitors`, `projects.audience`, and `drafts.checks`.\n   - **Embedded JSON relations**: `projects.links`, `items.thread`, `items.my_post`, `github_installations.repos`, `code_questions.sources`, and `ideas.result_links`.\n\nFor complete details, functional dependency proofs, and the full 28-table audit matrix, see [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-5in3MM/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":553.040723,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":307860,"output_tokens":57344,"thinking_tokens":44887,"cache_read_tokens":3220182,"total_tokens":365204}}}
